    ('Neon Theater Marquee', 'Look for that glowing vintage sign above a cinema entrance with movie titles spelled out in bright neon tubes, usually with a marquee structure.', 'Identify a theater marquee with glowing neon tubing spelling out show titles or theater name, featuring bright neon lettering and typical marquee structure with lights.', 'uncommon'::public.item_rarity, 'Neon tubes in theater marquees could last 8-15 years of continuous operation, making them more durable than most incandescent theater lighting of the era.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/c20354bc84e0fefa.jpg', 0),
