    ('Barbershop Neon Pole', 'Spot the iconic spinning barber pole with red, white, and blue neon lighting outside old-school barbershops on Main Street.', 'Identify the iconic spinning barber pole with red, white, and blue neon or lit stripes, positioned at barbershop entrance.', 'common'::public.item_rarity, 'The barber pole''s red-and-white spiral predates neon by centuries, but neon versions (often with blue added) became standard after the 1920s.', null, 5),
