    ('Vintage Motel Sign', 'Find roadside motels with tall neon signs on poles, often featuring arrows, the motel name, and sometimes vacancy/no vacancy indicators.', 'Recognize neon or illuminated vintage motel signage reading ''MOTEL'' or motel name with classic mid-century styling and glowing letters.', 'uncommon'::public.item_rarity, 'Classic motel signs used neon''s slow warm-up time (30 seconds to full brightness) as a feature—the gradual glow signaled ''availability'' to approaching drivers.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/84ca12991d519f2f.jpg', 7),
