    ('Restaurant Window Neon', 'Look for dining establishments with neon signs framed in their front windows, often advertising the restaurant name or cuisine type.', 'Capture neon lettering visible through or on restaurant window displaying restaurant name or ''RESTAURANT'' in glowing neon colors.', 'common'::public.item_rarity, 'Neon''s inherent flicker (60 times per second) isn''t visible to humans but subconsciously draws the eye—restaurants paid premium prices specifically for this invisible motion.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/13e481d44d6e5dd5.jpg', 9),
