    ('Tattoo Parlor Neon', 'Scout for tattoo studios with neon signs in their windows, usually glowing late into the night when the shops are still operating.', 'Find neon lettering reading ''TATTOO'' or tattoo shop name in glowing tubes on tattoo parlor entrance.', 'uncommon'::public.item_rarity, 'Tattoo parlor neon signs became iconic in the 1960s-70s, but neon itself has been continuously lit in some shops since the 1930s.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/b8b8e6955055860a.jpg', 12),
