    ('Vintage Pharmacy Neon', 'Look for old apothecaries or drugstores with vintage neon signs, often featuring a mortar and pestle or the pharmacy name glowing at night.', 'Detect neon sign reading ''PHARMACY'', ''DRUGS'', or pharmacy name in glowing tubes on vintage pharmacy storefront.', 'rare'::public.item_rarity, 'Pharmacy neon signs often incorporated a green cross, which neon can produce efficiently, making pharmacy signs notably cheaper to operate than many other businesses.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/5b20498d93e4c8d7.png', 14),
